WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:04.860
If you're on a split-dose prep, it's time to walk through your second dose.

2
00:00:04.860 --> 00:00:07.200
Confirm with your written instructions.

3
00:00:07.200 --> 00:00:11.280
Split dosing means you take the first half of your prep the evening before, and the second

4
00:00:11.280 --> 00:00:16.080
half the morning of your procedure — typically six hours before your arrival time.

5
00:00:16.080 --> 00:00:21.440
When you wake up tomorrow, mix and drink your second dose as directed on your prep instructions.

6
00:00:21.440 --> 00:00:25.840
Continue drinking clear liquids after your dose until the cutoff time we've specified.

7
00:00:25.840 --> 00:00:29.200
Your goal is to keep going until your output runs clear.

8
00:00:29.200 --> 00:00:31.340
That's how we know your prep is working.

9
00:00:31.340 --> 00:00:35.080
If you have any concerns about how things are going, call our office first thing in the

10
00:00:35.080 --> 00:00:36.080
morning.

11
00:00:36.080 --> 00:00:36.720
You're almost done.
